@PersonalPortfolio.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5016

### Read portfolio sample
GET {{PersonalPortfolio.Api_HostAddress}}/api/portfolio
Accept: application/json

### Check admin login configuration and current session
GET {{PersonalPortfolio.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/session
Accept: application/json

### Start Telegram Login (requires BotFather configuration)
GET {{PersonalPortfolio.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/login

### Logout (requires the admin cookie)
POST {{PersonalPortfolio.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/logout

### Resume website contact chat (requires the HttpOnly visitor cookie)
GET {{PersonalPortfolio.Api_HostAddress}}/api/contact-chat/session

### Send a website contact chat message (requires the HttpOnly visitor cookie)
POST {{PersonalPortfolio.Api_HostAddress}}/api/contact-chat/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Thank you for getting back to me."
}

### List visitor chats (requires the admin cookie)
GET {{PersonalPortfolio.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/contact-chats

### Read a visitor chat (replace with a session ID from the previous request)
GET {{PersonalPortfolio.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/contact-chats/{{chatId}}

### Reply to an active visitor chat (requires the admin cookie)
POST {{PersonalPortfolio.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/contact-chats/{{chatId}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Hello, thanks for reaching out."
}

### End a visitor chat and promote the next waiting visitor
POST {{PersonalPortfolio.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/contact-chats/{{chatId}}/close

###
